==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[H. Nah]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Trolly Blogger]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[H. Nah]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
**2 [[Cala Maria]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Cala Maria]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
H. Nahs themselves don't sound all that difficult and neither are the Cala Marias, but the presence of Devil Wives can wipe their usual counters in no time flat. For this reason, it's recommended to have means of hitting Cala Maria behind enemy lines and bring [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-Immune units]]. Your attackers should ideally outrange H. Nah, or else his damage and knockback ability will effectively stun-lock them, rendering them all useless.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]]: With the extreme quantity of DPS on the frontline, most meatshields won't be able to survive long enough. Boulder's extreme health and Surge/Knockback Immunity however dismisses all of these concerns. Boulder cannot serve as your only means of defense due to despawning soon afterwards, but it does significantly reduces pressure for other units, especially with Research [[Cat Combo|Combos]].
*[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]]: Even against non-[[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies, he has extremely high HP. With the help of a Research Combo, he can easily stall all enemies in this stage. Pair him with Boulder to take the pressure off of him every now and then and you'll have a good defense.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Kasli the Bane (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasli, Daughter of Chaos]]: Kasli, Daughter of Chaos is Surge-Immune and her own [[Surge Attack|Surges]] can disable H. Nah's knockback while easily taking out Devil Wives, and may even snipe Cala Maria. Kasli also outranges everything save for Cala Maria, making her a safe pick as long as a Surge-Immune frontline is there to prevent H. Nahs from damaging her.
*[[Lilin (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Lilin π]]: Divine Lilin π can (barely) outrange H. Nah, which will increase as she can use the other peons to snipe as well as to help her reposition, while also utilizing her Surge to clear them away. In addition, Lilin is strong against both Devil Wife and Cala Maria's traits.
*[[Talents|Ultra Talented]] [[Hayabusa (Uber Rare Cat)|Akuma Hayabusa]]: Hayabusa is Immune to Surge, Strong Vs. [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]], outranges H. Nah (albeit not by a lot), and with a stepping stone, he can also hit Cala Maria.
*[[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Supernova Cosmo]]: With the stage's short width and Cosmo's insane range, plus knockback against Angels, he turns this stage into a joke when combined with a sufficiently levelled Ramen Cat.

